    "name": "composition-a-holiday-that-falls-on-a-weekend-is-its-own-bucket",
    "why": "Calendar::dayType() makes a holiday beat a weekend deliberately, and 7 August is a Friday — a weekend day in this department — that is also Eid. Owner decision N's optional HOL bucket is what stops that duty being counted as an ordinary weekend one: p-ali holds two weekdays, one weekend day and the holiday, which is exactly the stated mix, and flattening the day type to two values makes them two over on weekends and one short on holidays. p-noor holds two weekend days and no holiday and is off in both directions at once, which is what proves the rule still fires rather than the case being green because nothing was measured.",
